        "domain_name": "African American History - African American Community Leaders in Florida",
        "standards": [
          {
            "id": "SS.4.AA.1.1",
            "text": "Identify African American community leaders who made positive contributions in the state of Florida (e.g., Zora Neale Hurston, Florida Highwaymen, Mary McLeod Bethune, Evan B. Forde, Bessie Coleman, Gen. Daniel \"Chappie\" James, Bob Hayes, Sylvia Fowles).",
